      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "***2 BEDROOM / 2 BATHROOM / EXCELLENT LOCATION / NEWLY RENOVATED IN 2011 / GFCH****\r\n\r\nWelcome to 18B Clonliffe Avenue, This home was built in 2010 and features 2 Bedrooms and  2 Bathrooms in a prime location.  As you step inside, you are immediately immersed in the modern open tiled kitchen which opens out to the large living/dining room boasting pale oak LVP which opens out to your patio area.  \r\n\r\nAt the base of the stairs there is a convenient WC. Upstairs there are 2 large bedrooms with a tiled family bathroom featuring a bath and an electric shower. The extra large bedroom to the rear features an enclosed balcony.\r\n\r\nBeyond the walls of this home, the surrounding neighbourhood complements this home with a wealth of local amenities. Nestled in a vibrant community, you will find an array of shops, dining options, and well-regarded schools all just a stone’s throw away. With lush parks and tranquil green spaces nearby, outdoor enthusiasts are afforded the perfect backdrop for leisurely strolls, picnics, or weekend adventures.\r\n\r\n18B Clonliffe Avenue is not merely a house, beyond the confines of this central residence, the location enhances the lifestyle this home affords. Situated just over 2 km north of Dublin city centre, you are mere moments away from an array of local shops, charming cafés, acclaimed restaurants, and vibrant bars. Stroll through Fairview Park or take advantage of easy access to the IFSC and Eastpoint Business Park. Commuting is effortless, with numerous bus routes and Connolly Dart Station just a short."
